{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13811","headline":"山居即事 · 顾况","name":"山居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下泊降茅仙，萧闲隐洞天。\n杨君闲上法，司命驻流年。\n崦合桃花水，窗分柳谷烟。\n抱孙堪种树，倚杖问耘田。\n世事休相扰，浮名任一边。\n由来谢安石，不解饮灵泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}